OL,3,AGoogle value plunges by $500bn as AI
OL,4,Afears rattle Wall Street
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle parent Alphabet lost just over
OL,7,F$500bn (#374bn) in value on Thursday
OL,8,Fafter it rattled Wall Street with its
OL,9,Flast update of the year on its business
OL,10,Foperations.
OL,12,FGoogle spooked investors so badly that
OL,13,Fits stock hit a six-month low, after it
OL,14,Frevealed its artificial intelligence
OL,15,F(AI) summaries on search were affecting
OL,16,Fad revenue.
OL,18,FMicrosoft and Amazon also updated
OL,19,Finvestors this week, and joined Google
OL,20,Fin plans to keep spending astronomical
OL,21,Fsums of cash in an ongoing AI race.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
