OL,3,AStar Trek stars lead tributes to
OL,4,A'magnificent actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter his death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FLegendary Star Trek actor Sir Patrick
OL,8,FStewart has died aged 86
OL,10,FHis co-stars have led tributes, with
OL,11,FWilliam Shatner saying that Stewart
OL,12,F"stood for the best of us"
OL,14,FMeanwhile, actor Hugh Jackman says "we
OL,15,Flost one of the greats of stage and
OL,16,Fscreen"
OL,18,FThe Royal Shakespeare Company describes
OL,19,Fthe actor as a "colossus" and flowers
OL,20,Fare due to be placed on his star on the
OL,21,FHollywood Walk of Fame
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
