OL,3,AStar Trek stars lead tributes to
OL,4,A'magnificent actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter his death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FStewart died at his home in Los Angeles
OL,8,Fon Wednesday, according to a statement
OL,9,Fshared on his social media
OL,11,FThe award-winning star had a career
OL,12,Facross decades - from the Shakespearean
OL,13,Fstage, to the X-Men franchise
OL,15,FHis appeal crossed generations, and
OL,16,Fyounger fans will have discovered his
OL,17,Fwork on streaming platforms, writes our
OL,18,Fculture correspondent Noor Nanji
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
