OL,3,ABombshell confession in The Traitors as
OL,4,Afaithfuls finally turn the screw
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs cliffhangers go, it wasn't hugely
OL,7,Fthrilling for viewers at home, given
OL,8,Fthat the pair up for banishment -
OL,9,FSharon Rooney and Joanne McNally - were
OL,10,Fboth faithfuls.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
